abstract: >
  This repository contains annotated datasets, BERT training notebooks,
  BERTopic topic modeling pipelines, and Claude API annotation prompts
  for a multi-stage computational analysis of consumer sustainability
  discourse in the fashion industry. The study proposes the
  Topic-Emotion-Strategy (TES) Framework to diagnose communication gaps
  between brand sustainability messaging and consumer discourse priorities.
keywords:
  - sustainable fashion
  - consumer discourse
  - BERT
  - BERTopic
  - topic modeling
  - emotion classification
  - communication gap
  - TES framework
  - greenwashing
  - Triple Bottom Line
  - Cognitive Appraisal Theory
  - Signaling Theory
